        "hero_subtitle": "Inside the atelier",
        "hero_title": "Inside Devs2 Rebel",
        "hero_description": "<p>A study in structure, proportion, and quiet defiance. We build a wardrobe around tactile materials, exacting cuts, and pieces that reward repeat wear.</p>",
        "show_mission": true,
        "mission_title": "A sharper kind of luxury",
        "mission_description": "<p>Devs2 Rebel designs clothing for a considered wardrobe: fewer pieces, stronger silhouettes, and materials chosen for texture, memory, and longevity.</p>",
        "show_story": true,
        "story_title": "What we make, and why",
        "story_content": "<p>We work between tailoring discipline and modern ease. Collections begin with proportion studies, fabric tests, and a simple question: will this still feel right years from now?</p><p>The result is a restrained luxury language with depth, movement, and clarity rather than noise.</p>",
        "show_gallery": true,
        "gallery_title": "Studio details",
        "hero_primary_label": "Explore collections",
        "hero_primary_link": "/collections",
        "hero_secondary_label": "Book an appointment",
        "hero_secondary_link": "/pages/contact",
        "show_actions": true,
        "actions_subheading": "Atelier support",
        "actions_title": "Continue with the studio",
        "actions_description": "<p>Move from brand story into something concrete: plan a fitting, follow the journal, or browse the current wardrobe edit.</p>",
        "action_1_eyebrow": "Private visits",
        "action_1_title": "Book a studio appointment",
        "action_1_text": "Request a private fitting, sizing guidance, or a wardrobe consultation with the atelier team.",
        "action_1_label": "Contact the atelier",
        "action_1_link": "/pages/contact",
        "action_2_eyebrow": "Editorial notes",
        "action_2_title": "Read the journal",
        "action_2_text": "Follow styling essays, material studies, and the way each collection is intended to be worn.",
        "action_2_label": "Open the journal",
        "action_2_link": "/blogs/style-guides-wardrobe-essentials",
        "action_3_eyebrow": "Current wardrobe",
        "action_3_title": "Shop the collections",
        "action_3_text": "Browse the latest edit across tailoring, outerwear, and layered essentials built around repeat wear.",
        "action_3_label": "View all collections",
